      "vimeoId": null,
      "section": "Module 1: Course Introduction",
      "contentHtml": "<p>Welcome to Level 3.1, focused on the practical usage of long put strategies. This course is designed for traders who have completed Levels 1, 2 and 3 and understand put options from the buyer's perspective.</p><h3>What to Expect</h3><ul><li><strong>Detailed case studies:</strong> Follow long put trades from setup and execution through monitoring and closing.</li><li><strong>Position management:</strong> Adjust positions as the market moves, mitigate risk and lock in profits.</li><li><strong>Trade analysis:</strong> Evaluate performance, market signals and the decisions behind each trade.</li><li><strong>Risk management:</strong> Identify, assess and manage the risks inherent in long put strategies.</li></ul><p>The module is designed to provide hands-on experience with long puts in real trading scenarios.</p>"
